/ A running task is listed under the actor that runs it: %!app.actor.current.task% finds it by its id while Slow
/ sleeps; once it ends its id finds nothing there, and %task% still holds it.
Start
- goal.call(Name="Slow", Parallel=true); variable.set(Name=%task%, Value=%!data%)
- variable.set(Name=%listed%, Value=%!app.actor.current.task[%task.id%]%)
- assert.equals(Expected=%task.id%, Actual=%listed.id%, Message="the running task is listed under its actor")
- task.wait(Task=%task%)
- variable.set(Name=%gone%, Value=%!app.actor.current.task[%task.id%]%); on.error(Key="VariableNotFound", Recovery=[goal.call(Name="Gone")])
- assert.isTrue(Value=%wasGone%, Message="an ended task is not listed")
- assert.isTrue(Value=%task.ended%, Message="%task% still holds the ended task")

Slow
- timer.sleep(Duration="1s")

Gone
- variable.set(Name=%wasGone%, Value=true)
